WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.088
In 1266 King Hethum I
hurried to the Mongols for help.

2
00:00:07.128 --> 00:00:10.038
His sons Leo and Thoros
led the defense

3
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:12.016
against a Mamluk army.

4
00:00:12.256 --> 00:00:15.646
In the battle remembered as Mari,
Vahram writes,

5
00:00:15.686 --> 00:00:17.689
the princes stood their ground.

6
00:00:17.729 --> 00:00:21.344
Thoros was killed,
and Leo was taken prisoner.

7
00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:23.754
Leo came home in 1268,

8
00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:26.253
and became king the next year.

9
00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:29.237
Hold the way into Cilicia.

